  "claim_ceiling": "Passing establishes only that, on the frozen four-G panel, one fixed neutral recurrent-plus-closure scaffold can replace the 24-token closure forward after each exact 27-token F-conditioned G attention advance while preserving all tested useful A/B/C/D boundaries. The fixed 130-token scaffold amortizes against the predecessor after six branches and the asymptotic variable source ratio falls from 51/130 to 27/130. Full-logit parity is diagnostic rather than expected. The mechanism still performs fresh G model forward and does not establish a direct label-group operator, numerical recursive fidelity, inverse restoration, vanishing fresh-work ratio, catalytic recurrence, Small Wall crossing, or unbounded inference."
